  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central American Minors (CAM) Program Parole Processing - El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is carried out in agreement with the United States Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS) to provide for the movements of self-paying migrants who are beneficiaries of the Central American Minors Parole Program. The project aims to contribute toward safe, orderly, and regular migration and mobility by providing movement assistance. The project is paying particular attention to migrants requiring special assistance, such as migrants in vulnerable situations, including migrants in irregular situations who may also require IOM assistance with facilitating the exit permission.</narrative>
  </description>
